Herdr Arcade
An 8-bit theme, layout and mods for the Herdr desktop app.

The mods in mods/arcade-* started as copies of mods that ship with Herdr
(agents, spaces, tabs, pane, toast, workspace-chrome, workspace-status),
made with `herdr-app do mod.clone`, and have been modified. Each mod.json
records the original under "cloned_from". Herdr is licensed under the
Apache License 2.0; see LICENSE.

mods/quest, the theme, the pixel art and the sound effects are new work in
this repository, released under the same license.
